\par\par \b \uc2  Dlr opens up in U.S.,  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk slows rise. \b0\par\par\uc2 574 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 1998\par 14:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, June 11 (Reuters) - Dollar/yen started modestly higher in New York as Asian markets slipped again, but some concern of concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  following the rapid run-up took the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  off fresh highs, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The greenback also edged higher against the mark, propped by a solid sterling bid and ongoing concerns that cash-strapped Russia may see further turmoil in its financial markets. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen achieved 142.08 overnight, just shy of the 142.10 high seen in June 1991, gaining as Tokyo's Nikkei 225 index fell 2.12 percent and as speculation of Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluations prompted some flight-to-quality. \par \par \uc2  "Nothing has changed in terms of Japan's well-being and the market merely needs to be attentive, and wait and see if there's going to be some kind of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a trader at a European bank in New York. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was little moved after data showed U.S. retail sales rose by 0.9 percent in May, stronger than forecasts for a 0.7 percent rise. Auto sales jumped 2.4 percent, the biggest rise since the component rose by 3.5 percent in February 1997. \par \par \uc2  Dollar/yen opened higher at 141.65/75, up from 141.47/57 at the close on Wednesday. Dollar/mark started up at 1.7995/00 from 1.7959/64. \par \par \uc2  Japanese officials' jawboning continued overnight but the talk had limited effects on dollar/yen's rise. \par \par \uc2  Vice Finance Minister Koji Tanami delivered the most potent comment overnight as he confirmed an intention by Group of Seven nations to cooperate on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  still exists. He declined to comment on the possibility of the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  joining in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but repeated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  will take "decisive action." \par \par \uc2  Doubts of concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  persisted but traders stressed any such talk must be heeded as the market seeks to protect fat profits built into dollar/yen since early April. \par \par \uc2  "I think people are getting a little nervous around here ... when everybody starts talking about getting bulled-up here it means it's getting near a top," said John Gariano, a vice president at Sumitomo Bank in New York. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, talk of a Chinese yuan or Hong Kong dollar devaluation in response to the yen's deterioration brewed and kept Asian markets on edge, despite more official statements that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' values would be preserved. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong Chief Secretary Anson Chan, speaking in Washington, told reporters that Hong Kong does not contemplate moving away from the Hong Kong dollar-U.S. dollar link. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, traders said the mark came under pressure as traders doubted the Group of 10 nation's commitment to provide financial aid to Russia. \par \par \uc2  Russia worries also sparked mark selling against the Swiss franc and the British pound. Dollar/mark was boosted to a seven-and-a-half week high at 1.8047 after the open. \par \par \uc2  In other trading, the Australian dollar firmed to $0.5923/28 from Wednesday's low of $0.5805 and close of $0.5882/87. The greenback was higher at 1.4882/87 Swiss francs from 1.4840/45 at the close on Wednesday and slightly lower at Canadian $1.4643/48 from C$1.4658/63. Sterling opened higher at $1.6332/42 from $1.6290/00. \par \par \uc2  ((-Al Yoon, N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1672)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6b0375m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
